        "description": "<p><strong>¿Por qué no los dos?</strong></p><p><em>—Mia Agraviador, Old El Paso Taco Commercial</em></p><p>Spellblades, gishes, arcane knights, and eldritch tricksters all. Magi are arcane specialists that blend magic and martial prowess.</p><h3>Iconic Magi</h3><ul><li><strong>Alucard</strong>, <em>Castlevania</em></li><li><strong>Elric of Melniboné</strong>, <em>Stormbringer</em></li><li><strong>Geralt of Rivia</strong>, <em>The Witcher</em></li><li><strong>Twilight Suzuka</strong>, <em>Outlaw Star</em></li></ul><h3>Playing Magus</h3><p>The magus may be a bit more challenging for newer players. Their playstyle is more build-dependent than the other classes, allowing for backline blasters, midline harassers, and frontline strikers.</p><p><strong>Action:</strong> Attack/Cast<br /><strong>Move:</strong> Flexible<br /><strong>Starting Pack:</strong> Knight, Gladiator, or Warrior<br /><strong>Key Stat:</strong> Reason<br /><strong>Complexity:</strong> ★★★★☆<br /><strong>Training:</strong> Arcana, Melee</p><h3>Class Features</h3><table class=\"NormalTable\"><tbody><tr><td><p><strong>Level</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Features</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Spells</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Mana</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Cast Max</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>1st</p></td><td><p>Arcanum, Enspell</p></td><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>2</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>2nd</p></td><td><p>Spell Parry (15+)</p></td><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>2</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>3rd</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>3</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>4th</p></td><td><p>Arcane Surge (1 Mana)</p></td><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>8</p></td><td><p>3</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>5th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>10</p></td><td><p>4</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>6th</p></td><td><p>Spell Parry (14+), Esoteric Flow</p></td><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>12</p></td><td><p>4</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>7th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>14</p></td><td><p>5</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>8th</p></td><td><p>Arcane Surge (2 Mana)</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>16</p></td><td><p>5</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>9th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>18</p></td><td><p>6</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>10th</p></td><td><p>Spell Parry (13+), Sword & Sorcery</p></td><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>20</p></td><td><p>6</p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
        "isSpellcaster": true,
        "levelFeatures": [
          {
            "level": 1,
            "name": "Arcanum",
            "description": "<p>You gain the Gish Perk (p. 69) and can Cast Spells using Arcana.</p><p><strong>Spells:</strong> You learn 2 Spells, one of which must always have a damage base. You learn 1 other Spell every 3 Levels hereafter.</p><p><strong>Mana:</strong> Your Max Mana is equal to (2 × your Level), and your Cast Max for Spells is equal to (1 + half your Level, round up).</p>",
